#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Auto-generated cross-language validation tests
Generated from: {{ protocol.name }} v{{ protocol.version }}

Validates encode/decode consistency between C and Python implementations.

Test Coverage:
- encode_match: Verifies C and Python produce identical encoded bytes
- decode_values: Verifies C and Python decode to identical field values
- round_trip: Verifies encode->decode preserves all field values
- edge_cases: Tests boundary values (min, max, zero) for each field

Usage:
    python test_cross_validation.py --harness ./test_harness
    python test_cross_validation.py --harness ./test_harness --packet GeolocateTelemetryCore
    python test_cross_validation.py --harness ./test_harness -v
    python test_cross_validation.py --harness ./test_harness --coverage
"""

